    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python File**\n\nI'm solidifying the design: the core Python file will be named `synthesize_text.py`. The primary function will be to transform text input into an audio byte stream. To make the process concrete, I've chosen Google Cloud Text-to-Speech as the external provider.\n\n\n**Outlining the Implementation**\n\nI've established the foundation: the `synthesize_text.py` file will handle the audio synthesis. I'm focusing on Google Cloud Text-to-Speech integration now. My next step will be to concretely write the file content using the `write` tool, ensuring the Google Cloud SDK is imported to make the provider clear.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789867690822,
          "start": 1789867688528
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc6d8250001kRMf387OcrW968",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc6d7c8d001F9ts2Zc0eIG0ir",
